Next.js 16 App Router base repurposed from trusted-founders-club tooling (not a second scaffold). Product auth, payments, DB, and Review Signal UI were stripped. Laura forest/cream tokens are in `app/globals.css`. Local Cormorant + Inter fonts and Header/Footer shell are Batch 1. See `docs/CODEBASE_ASSESSMENT.md`.
